716 0 obj
<<
  /Title (My workshop about Typst for the fhLUG in Campus Hagenberg)
  /Subject (On June 8th, 2026, I had the wonderful opportunity to lead a Typst workshop for the fh Linux User Group at Campus Hagenberg, made possible by Daniel Knittl-Frank's excellent organization. It was a fantastic experience, with enthusiastic and engaged participants. In this blog post, you'll find highlights from the workshop as well as access to the full recording (German).)
  /Keywords (Typst, Video, Workshop, fhLUG, Campus Hagenberg)
  /Author (Tim Peko (TimerErTim))
  /Creator (Typst 0.14.2)
  /ModDate (D:20260728173741Z)
  /CreationDate (D:20260728173741Z)
>>
endobj

